<h1>Check Sky Light (v3.6): Platform Overview & Ecosystem Wiki</h1>

<div class="quote-box">
  "When your car dashboard illuminates the 'Check Engine' light, you don't panic or invent folklore—you plug in an OBD-II scanner, read the diagnostic trouble code, and triage the mechanical reality. When the sky exhibits an anomaly, you Check Sky Light."
</div>

